      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Generate-on validation KPIs** (export with `python -m scripts.export_eval_metrics --results-dir evaluation/results/<run>`). Customer FCR is only valid when `allow_generate=true` / `fcr_claim_allowed=1`. Recorded Groq run: `validation_20261122T131433Z` — 82.5% FCR, 0pp fairness."
      }
    },
